        url: "https://oro.open.ac.uk/74820",
      },
      {
        name: "Fawdon et al. (2022): A CaSSIS and HiRISE map of the clay-bearing unit at Oxia Planum, Planetary and Space Science",
        url: "https://oro.open.ac.uk/82087",
